The Simpsons Arcade Vita changelog

v1.1
- The game files folder is now ux0:data/thesimpsonsarcade (was ux0:data/simpsons), so it no longer conflicts with The Simpsons Hit & Run.
  If you played v1.0, rename ux0:data/simpsons to ux0:data/thesimpsonsarcade to keep the game files and your save.

v1.0
- Initial release.
